                                <li><a href="#">Uncategorized</a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <div class="blog__container__post">
                        <img src="~/img/room10.jpg" alt="Blog Image">
                        <ul class="blog-meta">
                            <li><a href="#">by Lore Papp |</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#">Uncategorized |</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#">3 Comments</a></li>
                        </ul>
                        <a href="#" class="blog__container__post--title">The Power of Hotel Branding: Key Strategies and Success Stories at Minor Hotels</a>
                        <p>
                            Hotel branding plays a main role in how the hospitality industry develops. It is said to have...
